pySMESH: OCCT 8.0 removed the iterator headers of the TopTools, TColStd, Message and ShapeExtend containers; include the container header instead.

GEOM V9_16_0 ShHealOper includes five iterator headers that OCCT 8.0.0 removed, for example
TopTools_ListIteratorOfListOfShape.hxx and Message_ListIteratorOfListOfMsg.hxx. In OCCT 8.0.1
the header of each container still declares the iterator typedef as a deprecated alias of the
NCollection iterator. Each include names that container header instead. No compiled code
changes. The same port as patches/common_geometry_lib/GEOMAlgo_BlockFix_occt8_iterator_headers.patch.

